  "body": "**Wanted:** a GUI surface for saved cut recipes.\n\n#3073 adds the recipe library, the undoable command `ApplyCutRecipe`, and the MCP tools `save_cut_recipe`, `list_cut_recipes` and `apply_cut_recipe`. The GUI has no surface for them yet.\n\n**Done means:**\n\n- An operation's context menu has a command that saves the operation as a named recipe. A name that is already in the library asks before it replaces the recipe.\n- A list of the saved recipes applies one recipe to the current geometry pick, or to the stock. The apply goes through `ApplyCutRecipe`, so one undo removes it.\n- A refusal (a missing tool, an unknown material, a different material) shows the command's text.\n- A UI test pins the save, the apply and the undo.\n\nThe clean-room boundary of #3066 applies: no vendor wording, labels, parameter names or dialog flows.\n\nFollow-up of #3073.\n",
